<title>NORWAY: Aker says shareholders back merger plan.</title>
<headline>Aker says shareholders back merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's engineering and offshore group Aker ASA said on Thursday that shareholders at an extraordinary general assembly had approved a plan for merging Aker with RGI (Norway) AS.</p>
<p>It said further information would be issued later.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
